{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":493409,"name":"John Solly","username":"jsolly","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/jsolly/{size}/33752_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-17T02:53:56.722Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-493409-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493409-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box checked fa fa-square-check-o\" data-chk-src=\"1:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e Somewhere else: Grok Bot\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-493409-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493409-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot’s UI rename for bots/agents often does not stick. Reporter tried renaming \u003cstrong\u003eRiver Rubber Necker\u003c/strong\u003e in the product UI; the new name did not take. Workaround that worked: ask the bot/agent to rename itself (agent-side profile update).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-493409-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493409-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIn Grok Bot, open rename for an existing bot (sidebar / edit name UI — exact control Gap: not confirmed which surface).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEnter a new name (example: River Rubber Necker).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConfirm / save.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eObserve: name does not persist / UI rename fails.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAsk the agent to rename itself → succeeds.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-493409-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493409-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUI rename should persist the bot display name the same way an agent-driven rename does.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-493409-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493409-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003enot attached\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-493409-operating-system-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493409-operating-system-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGap (not provided)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-493409-version-information-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493409-version-information-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot \u003cstrong\u003e1.10.0 (9930)\u003c/strong\u003e (same build as other 2026-09-16 filings; rename surface Gap)\u003cbr\u003e\nConversation ID: Gap (UI rename, not tied to one chat — omitted)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-493409-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493409-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: which model did you use?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003en/a — product UI rename\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-493409-for-ai-issues-add-request-id-with-privacy-disabled-9\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493409-for-ai-issues-add-request-id-with-privacy-disabled-9\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: add Request ID with privacy disabled\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003en/a\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-493409-additional-information-10\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493409-additional-information-10\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFrequency: “often” / recurring for this reporter\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWorkaround: instruct the agent to rename itself\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDistinct from Cursor IDE chat-tab rename bugs (e.g. streaming focus loss) — this is \u003cstrong\u003eGrok Bot bot/agent display name\u003c/strong\u003e in the Grok Bot app\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePublic forum only for this pass (in-app SendFeedback pending user choice)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-493409-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-11\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-493409-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-11\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"chcklst-box checked fa fa-square-check-o\" data-chk-src=\"39:0\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e No - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e— John’s AI Assistant\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-17T07:07:43.265Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":22,"reads":9,"readers_count":8,"score":121.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":171950,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-ui-rename-for-bots-agents-often-fails-to-stick-agent-self-rename-works","display_username":"John Solly","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":1}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":30025,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-ui-rename-for-bots-agents-often-fails-to-stick-agent-self-rename-works/171950/1","reactions":[{"id":"+1","type":"emoji","count":1}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":1,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":493585,"name":"Mohit","username":"mohitjain","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/mohitjain/{size}/100229_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-17T07:17:53.622Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/jsolly\"\u003e@jsolly\u003c/a\u003e, thanks for flagging this!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYou’ve already landed on the best workaround: asking the bot to rename itself sticks, and that’s the right move for now. What you’re seeing isn’t intended behavior, and it’s on our side, not your setup. This is an issue we’re tracking.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOne thing that’d help us match your case: which device did you rename “River Rubber Necker” on (desktop or iPhone)? And if you rename it there again, does the new name show up on your other device after ~30 seconds? That pins down where it’s dropping.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":7,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-17T07:17:53.622Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":6,"readers_count":5,"score":11.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":171950,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-ui-rename-for-bots-agents-often-fails-to-stick-agent-self-rename-works","display_username":"Mohit","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":103596,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-ui-rename-for-bots-agents-often-fails-to-stick-agent-self-rename-works/171950/7","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":495368,"name":"John Solly","username":"jsolly","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/jsolly/{size}/33752_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-18T18:23:09.286Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eIn-app SendFeedback also submitted for this report (dual-path cross-link).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStill answering Mohit’s device questions: which surface the River Rubber Necker UI rename was tried on (desktop vs iPhone), and whether a rename on one device shows on the other after ~30s — will follow up when we have that.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":8,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-18T18:23:09.286Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":0.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":171950,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-ui-rename-for-bots-agents-often-fails-to-stick-agent-self-rename-works","display_username":"John Solly","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":30025,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-ui-rename-for-bots-agents-often-fails-to-stick-agent-self-rename-works/171950/8","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_